<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak FinMin rejects bids in 13-wk T-bill auction.</title>
<headline>Slovak FinMin rejects bids in 13-wk T-bill auction.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Slovak finance ministry on Wednesday rejected all 293 million crowns ($8.8 million) worth of bids in its auction of an unspecified tranche of 13-week T-bills, the Slovak central bank said in a statement on Wednesday. -- Bratislava Newsroom, 42-7-5218-402 ($ = 33.32 Slovak Crowns)</p>
</text>
